_olex2_refinement_description
;
1. Fixed Uiso
 At 1.2 times of:
  All C(H) groups, All C(H,H) groups, All N(H,H) groups, All N(H,H,H) groups
2. Restrained distances
 N2-N2A
 2.3 with sigma of 0.01
 N2A-C9
 1.3 with sigma of 0.01
 C9-N2
 1.3 with sigma of 0.01
 N2-C9 \\sim C9-N2A
 with sigma of 0.02
3. Uiso/Uaniso restraints and constraints
Uanis(N2) = Uanis(N2A)
4. Others
 Fixed Sof: C9(0.5) H9(0.5) N2(0.5) H2C(0.5) H2D(0.5) N2A(0.5) H2AA(0.5)
 H2AB(0.5)
 Fixed X: N2(0.501381) N2A(0.49862)
 Fixed Y: N2(0.08925) N2A(-0.089251)
 Fixed Z: N2(1.09458) N2A(0.905419)
5.a Secondary CH2 refined with riding coordinates:
 C1(H1D,H1E), C2(H2A,H2B)
5.b Aromatic/amide H refined with riding coordinates:
 C8(H8), C4(H4), C7(H7), C5(H5), C9(H9)
5.c X=CH2 refined with riding coordinates:
 N2(H2C,H2D), N2A(H2AA,H2AB)
5.d Idealised Me refined as rotating group:
 N1(H1A,H1B,H1C)
